WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,420
Standing in the altar of dead and alive children

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,560
The warm resentment of the past

3
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:09,680
In the end, it turned into a piece of wasteland

4
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:11,480
Really stabbed him to death

5
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:18,820
Give me the time and place

6
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:28,740
It’s about Sulu and the two souls. Don’t mess around. Don’t worry.

7
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,540
It won't ruin your plans

8
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,780
There are many good doors for banquets

9
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,500
First, Luo Yi, then others.

10
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:35,860
I'll arrange a styling room for you

11
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:38,140
If it is true that Luo Yi comes first and others come last

12
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:39,580
There's no way I can make it today

13
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:48,380
No, see you later. Have you seen him?

14
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:52,780
When will he come back? Will he come to the engagement party?
